{"steam_appid":3916860,"steam_name":"The Brewline","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916860/1410474963/d52b3ed64fd998420a899c5e5a406cd5e138305e/1780324127/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1780324525","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257347636/02231c4bed614e09e9510347fde24cc186bdece5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1780324525","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/48053e94d52a8dd4ae7140634885001b9684afd0/ss_48053e94d52a8dd4ae7140634885001b9684afd0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786619539","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/5e508869465b9f41a7be2dd594e0b078a5fc2730/ss_5e508869465b9f41a7be2dd594e0b078a5fc2730.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786619539","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/e330524e9544033fbcf9a529297f746f9180483a/ss_e330524e9544033fbcf9a529297f746f9180483a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786619539","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/ecd3654fbaf56500e6e16ae0bdfdb1b4dfbaefdd/ss_ecd3654fbaf56500e6e16ae0bdfdb1b4dfbaefdd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786619539","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/1d8ab230a42d37e82340ae7c57ed241383153e0c/ss_1d8ab230a42d37e82340ae7c57ed241383153e0c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786619539"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fda9f763f51d6b70f5f0e30615ea5343.poster.avif?t=1786619539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fda9f763f51d6b70f5f0e30615ea5343.webm?t=1786619539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fda9f763f51d6b70f5f0e30615ea5343.mp4?t=1786619539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volstead City is rotten and dangerous. Your brother—once the top bootlegger in town—was arrested in a police raid. Now it’s your turn to take over. As Potbellied Racoon and his men try to seize control of the city, you’ll need to dodge both the cops and the criminals while uncovering the truth behind your brother’s arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your brand, grow your crops, craft your booze, and meet eccentric customers across the city. Complete their quirky missions, build relationships, and grow your underground empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e80858f89eb595f00816e5c417b54c3b.poster.avif?t=1786619539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e80858f89eb595f00816e5c417b54c3b.webm?t=1786619539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beer to hard liquors — grow your ingredients and master the machines to craft a wide variety of drinks. Ferment, distill, barrel-age, and infuse flavors to create truly unique bottles then automate it all for maximum profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fd123ecef252e6cee35c56d2df4042cd.poster.avif?t=1786619539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fd123ecef252e6cee35c56d2df4042cd.webm?t=1786619539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own label, slap it on the bottle, and let the streets of Volstead know your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d81e05029bdd086f03ccc212ffb6d16b.poster.avif?t=1786619539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d81e05029bdd086f03ccc212ffb6d16b.webm?t=1786619539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three seasonal regions, drive unique vehicles, uncover neighborhoods, and meet a cast of colorful NPCs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/3a96590598a1148fb317666ab7598192.poster.avif?t=1786619539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/3a96590598a1148fb317666ab7598192.webm?t=1786619539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region has its own unique demands and preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the right drinks to the right neighborhoods, strengthen your contacts, and expand your network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through the districts, grow your influence, and become the one who runs the entire town.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/be951304dbd2af560dabb8f39331860f.poster.avif?t=1786619539\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/be951304dbd2af560dabb8f39331860f.webm?t=1786619539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Volstead’s streets are more than just business. Gangs make their own rules, and mistakes are never forgiven. Stay sharp, know who you’re dealing with, and stay alert if you want to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / AMD RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Alcora Games"],"publishers":["PlayWay S.A."],"release_date":"4 Jun, 2026"}